          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu ithi: Nxa sengibutha uIsrayeli ebantwini abachithachithwe kibo, ngizabonakalisa ubungcwele bami kibo phambi kwezizwe; bazahlala elizweni labo engalinika inceku yami uJakobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazahlala kilo belondolozekile, bakhe imizi, bahlanyele izivini. Bazahlala belondolozekile nxa sengithonisisa bonke omakhelwana babo ababenze inhlekisa. Ng’khona bazakwazi ukuba ngiyiNkosi uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.26"
            ]
          }
        }
